{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37172","headline":"春日题航头桥 · 翁洮","name":"春日题航头桥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故园桥上绝埃尘，此日凭栏兴自新。\n云影晚将仙掌曙，水光迷得武陵春。\n薜萝烟里高低路，杨柳风前去住人。\n莫怪马卿题姓字，终朝云雨化龙津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁洮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}